# Only site/ is deployed: it is a self-contained static build. Everything
# listed here is the research code that produced it -- trained agents, the
# OpenStreetMap network, figures, the virtualenv -- none of which the static
# dashboard reads at runtime.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. A bare "data" would also
# match site/data, which is the site's entire payload.
/.venv
/.git
/models
/data
/results
/tests
/truckdrone
/dashboard
/__pycache__
/*.pptx
/*.log
/*.md
/requirements.txt
/run_demo.py
